# ── Local/private financial data ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Keep only selected non-vault placeholder directories in Git. Never commit
# local market data, personal watchlists, caches, generated notes, job manifests,
# DBs, provider captures, or research/vault content.
data/**
!data/**/
!data/**/.gitkeep

kb/**
!kb/**/
!kb/**/.gitkeep

vault/

